<title>USA: Dialogic, Syntellect agreement.</title>
<headline>Dialogic, Syntellect agreement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dialogic Corp and Syntellect Inc detailed a licensing and distribution agreement on Friday.</p>
<p>Under the agreement Dialogic will offer its customers a portfolio of computer telephony patents from Syntellect subsidiary Syntellect Technology Corp.</p>
<p>Dialogic manufactures high-performance, standard-based computer telephony components and Syntellect Inc provides interactive communication solutions.</p>
</text>
